        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Executive Compensation — Target Pay Adjustments and Compensation Philosophy</title>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\" async></script>\n<style>\n  html, body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    background: #fff;\n  }\n  body {\n    font-family: \"DejaVu Sans\", \"Trebuchet MS\", Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n    color: #231f20;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    line-height: 1.35;\n  }\n  .page {\n    width: 8.5in;\n    min-height: 11in;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 0.85in 0.75in 0.5in 0.75in;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    position: relative;\n  }\n  .green { color: #76b900; }\n  strong.green { color: #76b900; font-weight: bold; }\n\n  /* ---- Top two-column zone ---- */\n  .top-zone {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n    gap: 30px;\n  }\n  .col-left { width: 47%; }\n  .col-right { width: 53%; }\n\n  h3.sec {\n    font-size: 15.5px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    margin: 0 0 14px 0;\n  }\n\n  ul.bul {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding-left: 26px;\n    list-style: none;\n  }\n  ul.bul > li {\n    position: relative;\n    margin-bottom: 18px;\n    padding-left: 4px;\n  }\n  ul.bul > li::before {\n    content: \"\\2022\";\n    position: absolute;\n    left: -14px;\n    top: 0;\n  }\n  ul.bul > li.tight { margin-bottom: 4px; }\n\n  /* ---- Arrow rows in right column ---- */\n  .arow {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    margin-bottom: 24px;\n  }\n  .arow .lhs {\n    width: 44%;\n    line-height: 1.3;\n  }\n  .arow .arrow {\n    width: 78px;\n    text-align: center;\n    color: #76b900;\n    font-size: 34px;\n    line-height: 1;\n    flex-shrink: 0;\n  }\n  .arow .rhs {\n    flex: 1;\n    line-height: 1.3;\n  }\n  .arow.r1 { margin-top: 4px; }\n  .arow.r3 { margin-top: 40px; }\n\n  /* ---- Increased Performance Goals ---- */\n  .goals {\n    margin-top: 26px;\n  }\n  .goals h3 { margin-bottom: 8px; }\n\n  /* ---- Philosophy section ---- */\n  .philo {\n    margin-top: 90px;\n  }\n  .philo h3 {\n    color: #76b900;\n    font-size: 15.5px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    margin: 0 0 16px 0;\n  }\n  p.just {\n    text-align: justify;\n    margin: 0 0 16px 0;\n  }\n  ul.philolist {\n    margin: 0 0 0 0;\n    padding-left: 52px;\n    list-style: none;\n  }\n  ul.philolist > li {\n    position: relative;\n    margin-bottom: 18px;\n    text-align: justify;\n  }\n  ul.philolist > li::before {\n    content: \"\\2022\";\n    position: absolute;\n    left: -22px;\n    top: 0;\n    font-size: 16px;\n  }\n  .pagenum {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    margin-top: 340px;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <div class=\"top-zone\">\n    <!-- LEFT COLUMN -->\n    <div class=\"col-left\">\n      <h3 class=\"sec\">Target Pay Adjustments</h3>\n      <ul class=\"bul\">\n        <li>Increase in proportion of &ldquo;at-risk&rdquo; target pay to <strong class=\"green\">96%</strong> of CEO target pay and <strong class=\"green\">90%</strong> of other NEO target pay</li>\n        <li>Increased CEO target variable cash to 200% of base salary (representing 50th percentile of peers)</li>\n        <li>No changes to NEOs (other than our CEO) base salary or target variable cash for the fourth consecutive year</li>\n        <li class=\"tight\">Increase CEO target equity by 33%, increase weighting of MY PSUs to 50% of CEO&rsquo;s total target equity</li>\n        <li>Increase NEOs (other than our CEO) target equity by 39%</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- RIGHT COLUMN -->\n    <div class=\"col-right\">\n      <h3 class=\"sec\">Performance Achievement; Maximum Payouts</h3>\n\n      <div class=\"arow r1\">\n        <div class=\"lhs\"><span class=\"green\">Revenue</span> exceeded<br>Stretch Operating<br>Plan goal</div>\n        <div class=\"arrow\">&#10132;</div>\n        <div class=\"rhs\">Variable cash payout<br>at <strong class=\"green\">200%</strong> of target</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"arow r2\">\n        <div class=\"lhs\"><span class=\"green\">Non-GAAP Operating Income</span> exceeded<br>Stretch Operating<br>Plan goal</div>\n        <div class=\"arrow\">&#10132;</div>\n        <div class=\"rhs\"><strong class=\"green\">200%</strong> (<strong class=\"green\">150%</strong> for CEO)<br>of target SY PSU<br>shares eligible to vest</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"arow r3\">\n        <div class=\"lhs\"><span class=\"green\">3-year relative TSR</span><br>exceeded Stretch goal</div>\n        <div class=\"arrow\">&#10132;</div>\n        <div class=\"rhs\"><strong class=\"green\">200%</strong> (<strong class=\"green\">150%</strong> for CEO)<br>of target MY PSU<br>shares eligible to vest</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Increased Performance Goals -->\n  <div class=\"goals\">\n    <h3 class=\"sec\">Increased Performance Goals</h3>\n    <ul class=\"bul\" style=\"width:47%\">\n      <li>Fiscal 2022 revenue and Non-GAAP Operating Income Threshold goals set above Fiscal 2021 performance</li>\n    </ul>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Philosophy -->\n  <div class=\"philo\">\n    <h3>Our Compensation Philosophy and Practices</h3>\n    <p class=\"just\">NVIDIA is building a one-of-a-kind company that invents the future, builds amazing technologies, and strives to achieve the highest level of craft.&nbsp; To achieve this vision, we must attract and retain a high-caliber executive team while balancing our stockholders&rsquo; interests.&nbsp; While our CC considers numerous factors in making executive pay decisions, our compensation program is guided by the following goals and philosophies:</p>\n\n    <ul class=\"philolist\">\n      <li><strong>Pay for Performance:</strong>&nbsp; emphasize at-risk and performance-based cash and equity for NEOs based on multiple corporate metrics</li>\n      <li><strong>Provide Competitive Pay:</strong>&nbsp; NEO target compensation should be competitive with our peers; reflects job impact, scope, and responsibilities; and is structured to attract and retain talent</li>\n      <li><strong>Stockholder Alignment:</strong>&nbsp; structure NEO pay to align with stockholders&rsquo; long-term interests and adjust in response to feedback received through our annual stockholder engagement and our annual &ldquo;say-on-pay&rdquo; vote</li>\n      <li><strong>Simplicity and Transparency:</strong>&nbsp; utilize clear, simple performance metrics that are defined and reported publicly</li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <p class=\"just\" style=\"margin-top:20px;\">Our executive compensation program adheres to the following practices:</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"pagenum\">40</div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
